    "path": "README.md",
    "lines": [
      "# shevinum.dev",
      "A tmux-shaped portfolio. Every page is a pane.",
      "## Stack",
      "- Astro for routing and static output",
      "- Svelte islands for pane state and keymaps",
      "- Tailwind for panel, list and status-bar styling",
      "## Local",
      "pnpm install && pnpm dev",
      "Press / anywhere in the site to grep the source of the site itself."
    ]
